
# Lapis preview links encode the whole storefront config in the URL, including
# comingSoonEnabled. A committed one is a public bypass of the coming-soon page,
# and this repository is public. Previews get handed over in chat, never here.
PREVIEW-LINK.txt
*preview-link*
*.ov.txt
__pycache__/
# cut/ holds the vial pipeline's working directories. The intermediates stay
# out of the repo; the SOURCE PHOTOGRAPHS do not.
#
# src/ is the master studio shoot — one vial photographed once and re-labelled
# seventeen times. Every vial render, every ledge product tile, the floating
# set, the hand shot and the spa composites are built from it. It used to be
# ignored and fetched from the store's CDN on demand, which quietly made the
# whole visual system depend on files that are ALSO the live product images:
# replacing those in the admin could have taken the masters with them, and
# nothing could be re-rendered again without a reshoot. 22MB is a cheap
# insurance premium against that.
truemg/assets/vials/cut/out/
truemg/assets/vials/cut/brand/
truemg/assets/web/hero-media.png
